  entry .apply
    info
        - an `Addable` instance from a function of the two operands
        + une instance `Addable` à partir d'une fonction des deux opérandes
    detail
        - `Addable((left, right) => …)` makes an `augend is Addable by addend to result`, with the
        - three types inferred from the expected type, as a given's declared type provides them.
        + `Addable((left, right) => …)` crée un `augend is Addable by addend to result`, les trois
        + types étant inférés à partir du type attendu, tel que le fournit le type déclaré d'un
        + given.
